      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Approvals\nReads my replies to the preview emails and approves or rejects the lead.\n\n- Reply \"yes\" (or \"sí\", \"ok\", \"vale\") to approve, \"no\" to reject. Only the first word counts.\n- Only replies from my own address count, only inside the thread the preview started, and only for a lead still waiting for approval.\n- Set your address in Read Decision and in the search of Watch Approval Replies.\n- Must be published, so it can check the inbox every five minutes.",
